cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use or adapt these course materials, please cite them as below."
title: "Federal Open Water Data for Researchers"
abstract: >-
  Learning materials for a CUAHSI micro-credentialing course on finding, retrieving and combining
  federal open water data (NASA SWOT, the NOAA National Water Model and USGS Water Data for the Nation)
  with Python. Includes the course website (MyST Markdown lessons) and generated teaching materials
  (slides, readings, notebooks, quizzes and an instructor guide).
